      },
      "text": "Crossing the Drake Passage"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "515ac2b5da1f352ffa0664230e757873780cd72f390eb826422b93ab7efdaa8e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6ksoy5-ph2ue2h6fz",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "You spend days 2–3 in the Drake Passage. Cool, salty winds, ocean swells and seabirds accompany you as you sail south. You may spot whales during the crossing. Look out for wandering, grey-headed and black-browed albatrosses, light-mantled sooty albatrosses, Cape petrels, southern fulmars, Wilson’s storm petrels, blue petrels and Antarctic petrels."
    },
